---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SEO from "../components/SEO.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Wordle Hint Today - Daily Wordle Clues & Help"
	description="Learn about Wordle Hint Today, an independent website providing daily Wordle hints, clues, answers, and puzzle guides."
>


<SEO
	title="About Wordle Hint Today"
	description="Wordle Hint Today provides daily Wordle hints, clues, answers and strategies to help players solve puzzles."
/>


<main class="about-page">


<section class="hero">

<h1>
About Wordle Hint Today
</h1>

<p>
Helping Wordle players solve puzzles with smart hints, useful clues, and spoiler-controlled answers.
</p>

</section>



<section class="content-card">


<h2>
What is Wordle Hint Today?
</h2>


<p>
Wordle Hint Today is an independent Wordle assistance website created for players who enjoy solving daily word puzzles.
</p>


<p>
Our goal is simple: provide helpful clues before revealing the final answer. Players can choose how much help they need, from small hints to the complete solution.
</p>


</section>




<section class="content-card">


<h2>
How We Help Wordle Players
</h2>



<div class="grid">


<div class="feature">

<h3>
Daily Hints
</h3>

<p>
Get fresh Wordle clues updated for the daily puzzle.
</p>

</div>



<div class="feature">

<h3>
Progressive Help
</h3>

<p>
Reveal hints step by step instead of seeing the answer immediately.
</p>

</div>



<div class="feature">

<h3>
Puzzle History
</h3>

<p>
Explore previous Wordle answers and historical puzzle information.
</p>

</div>


</div>


</section>




<section class="content-card">


<h2>
Our Approach
</h2>


<p>
We focus on creating a simple, fast, and enjoyable experience for Wordle fans. Our content is designed to help users continue learning word patterns, improve vocabulary, and enjoy the daily challenge.
</p>


<p>
All information is presented as an independent resource for puzzle enthusiasts. Wordle Hint Today is not affiliated with or endorsed by The New York Times Company.
</p>


</section>




<section class="cta">


<h2>
Ready for Today's Puzzle?
</h2>


<p>
Visit our homepage for today's Wordle hints and clues.
</p>


<a href="/">
Get Today's Hints →
</a>


</section>



</main>



</Layout>



